{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Init.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.SigmaJGeometricCarrier"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_fixes_real_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_fixes_real_form","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L146-L152","doc":"**`Fix(c)` is a real form** — every vector of the form `(w, w̄)` is `c`-fixed.\nRanging over `w ∈ GInt⁴` (the lattice model of `ℂ⁴`) this exhibits a real\nsubspace of `dim_ℝ = 8 = b₁(Bring)`: `c` is exactly the `H¹(ℝ)` Weil real\nstructure. (Python check 2d.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_swaps_hodge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_swaps_hodge","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L140-L144","doc":"**`c` swaps the Hodge pieces** — `c(a, 0) = (0, ā)`: it maps `H^{1,0}`\n(second slot zero) into `H^{0,1}` (first slot zero). (Python check 2b.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_ne_F_on_witness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_ne_F_on_witness","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L134-L138","doc":"**`c ≠ F`** as maps: they disagree at `v0`. `(F v0)₁(0) = i` (linear: just\nswap) while `(c v0)₁(0) = ī = −i` (antilinear: swap then conjugate). The\nantilinear/linear distinction therefore has content — the Weil real structure is\nNOT the ℂ-linear Galois structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.v0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.v0","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L131-L132","doc":"A concrete test vector with an imaginary entry in the `H^{0,1}` slot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.F_linear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.F_linear","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L125-L129","doc":"**`F` is ℂ-linear** — `F(λ·v) = λ·F(v)`. The Galois structure is linear,\ndistinguishing it from `c`. (Python check 2c.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_antilinear","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_antilinear","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L116-L123","doc":"**`c` is antilinear** — `c(λ·v) = λ̄·c(v)`. This is what makes `c` the Hodge\nconjugation (an anti-linear involution), the type-consistent B2 object. Uses\n`conj_mul`. (Python check 2c.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.F_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.F_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L112-L114","doc":"**`F` is an involution** — `F ∘ F = id`. `SWAP²  = id`. (Python 2a.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_involutive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.c_involutive","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L106-L110","doc":"**`c` is an involution** — `c ∘ c = id`. The Weil `SWAP ∘ conj` is a genuine\n(real) structure on `H¹`. Uses `conj_conj`; not a `rfl`. (Python check 2a.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjPiece_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjPiece_zero","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L102-L104","doc":"Piecewise conjugation fixes the zero piece: `0̄ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjPiece_conjPiece","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjPiece_conjPiece","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L98-L100","doc":"Piecewise conjugation is an involution (lifts `conj_conj`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conj_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conj_mul","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L91-L96","doc":"Complex conjugation is multiplicative: `conj(x·y) = x̄·ȳ`. The one nonlinear\n`ℤ`-identity behind antilinearity; proved from core `Int` lemmas (no `ring`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conj_conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conj_conj","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L87-L89","doc":"Complex conjugation on `GInt` is an involution: `z̄̄ = z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.smul","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L84-L85","doc":"Scalar multiplication by a Gaussian integer (the lattice `ℂ`-action). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.FGal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.FGal","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L80-L82","doc":"**The Galois real structure** `F = σ* = SWAP` — ℂ-linear, distinguished from\n`c` by linearity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.cWeil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.cWeil","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L76-L78","doc":"**The Weil real structure** `c = SWAP ∘ conj` — the antilinear involution the\nB2 statement names \"Hodge conjugation\". ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjV","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L73-L74","doc":"Coordinatewise complex conjugation on the whole `H¹` (the antilinear part). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.SWAP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.SWAP","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L69-L71","doc":"`SWAP` — exchanges `H^{1,0} ↔ H^{0,1}` (the ℂ-linear Galois structure `F`,\nand the linear part of the Weil `c`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjPiece","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.conjPiece","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L66-L67","doc":"Componentwise complex conjugation on one Hodge piece. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.H1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.H1","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L62-L64","doc":"The 8-dim weight-1 Hodge structure `H¹(Bring) = H^{1,0} ⊕ H^{0,1}`, ordered\nbasis `[dz₁…dz₄ | dz̄₁…dz̄₄]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.Piece","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.HodgeWeilRealStructure.Piece","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/HodgeWeilRealStructure.lean#L58-L60","doc":"One Hodge piece: a 4-dim `GInt`-lattice (the model of `H^{1,0}` or of\n`H^{0,1}`, each `≅ ℂ⁴` as the three `E_{5τ₀}` factors plus the `E_{τ₀}` factor). ","signatureChunk":0}]}